# Preset portraits. Faces are a licensing/consent question, not a code one, so
# no image lands in this repo until its provenance is recorded. The app
# degrades to placeholder cards without them. See public/presets/README.md.
public/presets/*.jpg
public/presets/*.png
public/presets/*.webp
